  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Center-West Region Roads project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to stimulate economic growth of the country and contribute indirectly to the objectives of the government&apos;s Poverty Reduction Strategy Program. The project would contribute to the economic and social development of the center-west region and increase the competitiveness of the Ivoirian economy in the West African sub-region. On the international level, the project would contribute to promoting regional integration between Cote d&#x2019;Ivoire, Guinea, Liberia and Sierra Leone.</narrative>
  </description>
